WEBVTT

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:31.647
are Latinos and Black Americans.

00:02:31.981 --> 00:02:36.402
And that's the case in an area
called "Cancer Alley."

00:02:37.028 --> 00:02:40.573
Now, there's a song
sung by the late Nat King Cole

00:02:40.615 --> 00:02:42.283
called "Unforgettable."

00:02:42.783 --> 00:02:45.286
And that is what "Cancer Alley" is.

00:02:45.328 --> 00:02:46.954
It is unforgettable.

00:02:46.996 --> 00:02:48.915
It's in the worst possible way.

00:02:49.415 --> 00:02:54.754
It's a 75-mile corridor between
New Orleans and Baton Rouge.

00:02:54.795 --> 00:03:00.551
It's a continuum of petrochemical
and plastics manufacturing facilities